#ASSERT `o 39 r 10(1) the enforcement order cannot yet be issued` TRUE (Date 21 3 2023) (Date 20 3 2023) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 39 r 10(1) the enforcement order cannot yet be issued` TRUE (Date 21 3 2023) (Date 20 3 2023) (JUST (Date 30 3 2023)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 39 r 10(1) the enforcement order cannot yet be issued` TRUE (Date 31 3 2023) (Date 20 3 2023) (JUST (Date 30 3 2023)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 39 r 10(1) the enforcement order cannot yet be issued` FALSE (Date 31 3 2023) (Date 20 3 2023) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
