#ASSERT `o 39 r 10(3) the party wishing to apply has produced what the Rule requires` TRUE (`o 39 r 10(3) what the party produces` OF FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 39 r 10(3) the party wishing to apply has produced what the Rule requires` TRUE (`o 39 r 10(3) what the party produces` OF TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 39 r 10(3) the party wishing to apply has produced what the Rule requires` FALSE (`o 39 r 10(3) what the party produces` OF TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- Rule 11 (lines 5574-5583) ----
#ASSERT `o 39 r 11(1)(a) the application for an order specified in section 85(3) may be made` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 39 r 11(1)(a) the application for an order specified in section 85(3) may be made` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- made before the application for registration: outside the window "together with or at any time after" (F39.3)
